   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br><strong>Enhances:</strong> Neuroport or Personal Link<br><strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances a Neuroport/Personal Link. While using the enhanced Personal Link to operate a cyberlinked vehicle or similar machine, the user gets +1 to the skill that requires (Drive Land Vehicle, Pilot Air Vehicle, and so on). The bonus also covers weapons run purely through a Personal Link, such as ones in a Vehicle Heavy Weapon Mount or ACPA. It doesn't stack with a Smartgun Link or Smart Rebuild. When the Personal Link connects to a Cyberdeck for a Netrun, all the user's rezzed non-Black-ICE programs get +1 to ATK or DEF, chosen when they Jack In.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
